# The desk scientist when the hero talks to him (scene 0's object 1, the
# comportement at 23): in chapter 0 he says text 18 (MESSAGE 18, offset 61),
# then carries on at 70. Hooked there: to Zoe in the coat, something else.

== life
  IF BODY_OBJ(0) == 4 else @threat
  MESSAGE "Busy, busy! The dreamer in the cells is all yours."
  ELSE 70
threat:
  MESSAGE 18
  ELSE 70
